        "Content": "REDUCED FOR QUICK SALE. \r\n\r\nABSOLUTE BARGAIN\r\n\r\nAbbey Property Sales are pleased to offer to the market this stunning detached, 4 Bed, 2 Ensuite home at Errew Drive in Lough Rinn.\r\n\r\nThe property comes to the market in pristine condition inside and out. \r\n\r\nB2 Energy rating and qualifies for a Green Mortgage. \r\n\r\n\r\nNo. 13 Errew Drive, Lough Rinn, Mohill, Co. Leitrim\r\n\r\nA beautifully presented family home located close to the stunning  Lough Rinn Castle Hotel, this property offers modern comfort, quality features, and exceptional convenience.\r\n\r\nStep inside to a warm and inviting interior, enhanced by oil-fired central heating . A central vacuum system, smart home music system.\r\n\r\nEntertainment and connectivity are seamless thanks to the built-in media centre with ceiling speakers and wall control panels.\r\n\r\nOutside, the home offers both beauty and practicality:\r\n\r\n\r\nA large patio area creates the perfect space for outdoor gatherings and relaxation. The gardens are mature and very well designed for comfort and beauty\r\n\r\nThis is a turn-key property ideal for modern living in a tranquil lakeside setting.\r\n\r\nAccommodation.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall. 3.61 m x 2.97 m. stunning bright area with feature staircase & tiling.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room. 5.31 m x 3.96 m. large room with feature painted kitchen, granite worktop, all appliances included . \r\n\r\nUtility. 2.49 m x 1.72 m. lovely fitted units with washing machine & dryer, back door.\r\n\r\nWC. 1.76 m X 1.6 m.  quality tiling, wash basin & wc.\r\n\r\nSitting Room. 4.12 m x 4.10 m. stunning room with 4 windows for dual aspect and light, fireplace & coving.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1. ground floor. 4.17 m x 3.48 m. currently used as a 2nd sitting room.  large room with a bay window, coving, tiled.\r\nWalk in Wardrobes. 1.73 m x 1.37 m. fully fitted units.\r\n\r\nEnsuite. 1.61 m x 1.91 m.  shower, feature tiling, whb & wc.\r\n\r\nLanding. 5.38 m x 3.54 m.  large bright area with two windows for dual aspect, carpeted.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2. 4.05 m x 3.93 m. large bright room to the front of house, 3 windows,  wardrobe, carpeted.\r\n\r\nEnsuite. 1.84 m x 1.73 m. fully tiled room with shower, whb & wc.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3. 4.05 m x 4.05 m. large room with built in wardrobes, carpet & 2 windows.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4. 3.52 m x 3.43 m. large room with carpet, two windows for dual aspect, .\r\n\r\nBathroom. 2.21 m x 1.88 m. quality fully tiled room with  bath, whb & wc.\r\n\r\nThis is a stunning home just a short drive to Lough Rinn House & Gardens, Lovely peaceful area.\r\nPresented in showhouse condition. \r\n\r\nCall Gerry on 086 8066701 for further information or to book a viewing.\r\nDon't miss this one.\r\n\r\n\r\n\"All information provided is to the best of our knowledge, information & belief. The utmost care and attention on our part has been placed on providing factual and correct information. Please note that in certain instances some information may have been provided directly by the owner to ourselves. Whilst due attention and care is taken in preparing particulars, this firm does not hold itself responsible for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get a professional opinion on any concern they may have.\""
